                <h3>Pre-Authorization and Cost Confirmation</h3>
                <p>Before traveling to China for planned procedures, obtain written pre-authorization from your chosen hospital. This document should confirm:</p>

                <ul>
                    <li>The specific procedure(s) to be performed with their CPT/ICD codes where applicable</li>
                    <li>A detailed cost breakdown in both RMB and a specified foreign currency (usually USD)</li>
                    <li>Confirmation of the quoted price validity period (typically 30-60 days)</li>
                    <li>The hospital's cancellation and refund policy</li>
                    <li>Point-of-contact information for financial inquiries</li>
                </ul>

