                    <h4>&#x2705; Best Practice: Get Everything in Writing</h4>
                    <p>Email correspondence confirming the estimate is acceptable, but insist on a formal letter or document with the hospital's official stamp for significant procedures. This written confirmation becomes your primary reference point if any billing disputes arise later and demonstrates due diligence on your part.</p>
                </div>

